QuestGuidance.Register("en",328,{
[10465]="70045443\n1\tDefeat Ghûrdhos corruptors (total: 5)\030Destroy corrupted roots (total: 5)\tGhûrdhos can be found throughout the Drúadan Forest. You should defeat Ghûrdhos.\n2\tSpeak with Ghân-buri-Ghân\tGhân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.\n",
[10466]="70030A13\n1\tFree the Huorn of its webbed trap (total: 4)\tSpider webs have stopped the Huorn in its tracks, covering it thoroughly. The Huorn is outside the entrance to a foreboding area. You should help free the Huorn; hopefully it is not hostile. HINT: Hit 'n' to toggle item names to ON if you have trouble selecting the webs.\n2\tSpeak with the Huorn you freed\tThe Huorn you freed from webs is at the foot of some foreboding steps in a deep part of Fangorn's eaves, far to the north. You should speak with the Huorn you so mercifully assisted.\n",
[10467]="7004DA68\n1\tCollect chunks of dwarf-gold from newly-exposed veins (total: 12)\tNewly-exposed veins can be found in rocky areas surrounding Erebor. Bráthi has asked you to investigate newly-exposed veins of gold around Erebor. If you recover any dwarf-gold, he has asked you to deliver it to him.\n2\tDeliver the chunks of dwarf-gold to Bráthi\tBráthi can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have uncovered a substantial amount of dwarf-gold in the newly-exposed veins outside Erebor and should now return to Bráthi.\n",
[10468]="70060011\n1\tCollect blood-root (total: 16)\030Add feed to the feed buckets (quantity: see journal)\tBlood-root can be found in north west Câr Bronach. Clavanail can be found just west of Eiricháv. You should collect blood-root and feed the carrion-crows for Aighrig.\n2\tTalk to Aighrig at Eiricháv\tEiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach. You should talk to Aighrig at Eiricháv.\n3\tGive one blood-root to Lúkhag\tEiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach. You should give one blood-root to Lúkhag.\n4\tPlace the rest of the blood-root in a supply chest\tEiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach. You should place the rest of the blood-root in a supply chest.\n",
[10469]="70053E38\n1\tCollect branches (total: 10)\tBranches can be found along the eastern edge of Rath Dúath. You should collect branches so the man and his family do not go cold.\n2\tBring the branches to the strange man\tThe strange man can be found at his cabin. You should bring the branches to the strange man.\n",
[10470]="700718EA\n1\tInspect Orcs infected with blight (total: 4)\030Defeat Orcs in Mokh Grazádh (total: 8)\tYou found a dead Orc with rot from the pale blight on it. You should search the camp for any additional signs of the blight spreading through the Orcs' ranks.\n2\tSpeak with Tálbiral in Laivárth\tYou investigated Mokh Grazádh and found more Orcs that have died from the blight. Tálbiral nearby in Laivárth would likely want to hear about this.\n",
[10471]="70072F8B\n1\tDefeat wood-trolls east of Sul Madásh (total: 8)\tMálacál has asked that you travel to the east of Sul Madásh and help her and her hunters thin the number of blighted wood-trolls that can be found.\n2\tReturn to Málacál\tReturn to Málacál near Sul Madásh and report your success of defeating wood-trolls in eastern Adagím.\n",
[10472]="7003EAFC\n1\tDefeat crawlers in Tâl Bruinen (total: 10)\tThere are crawlers infesting Tâl Bruinen, in the Trollshaws. While in Tâl Bruinen, you should purge as many of the foul crawlers destroying the vegetation there as you can.\n",
[10473]="700306C9\n1\tExamine soil samples in Fangorn (total: 10)\tSamples of soil can be found in the eastern parts of the Black Heart in Fangorn. You should examine the soil to see if it contributes to the corruption of the Black Heart.\n2\tCompleted\tIt is clear that the Black Heart is rotten from its very roots, with vile crawlers squirming out of every patch of mud.\n",
[10474]="70048F83\n1\tDefeat Rotwing\tRotwing can be found patrolling Mordor. You have encountered the threatening Rotwing. Roaming the burning plains of Dor Amarth, the beast patrols with her handlers.\n2\tDefeat Rotwing\tRotwing can be found patrolling Mordor. You have encountered the threatening Rotwing. Roaming the burning plains of Dor Amarth, the beast patrols with her handlers.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Rotwing.\n",
[10475]="7006F08C\n1\tSend cows back home (total: 5)\030Send horses back home (total: 3)\tSome of Ashnân's livestock have been left out in the fields, and he needs your help sending them back home. Find them near Burukíri and encourage them to return.\n2\tReturn to Ashnân in Burukíri\tYou have found the livestock that wandered off and sent them back home to Burukíri. Return to Ashnân and make sure he knows.\n",
[10476]="7000178D\n1\tDefeat enraged shades at Amon Amrûn\tEnraged shades can be found roaming Amon Amrûn in the eastern Fields of Fornost. You should defeat shades that patrol the surface of the ruined tombs.\n2\tDefeat shades at Amon Amrûn (total: 8)\tEnraged shades can be found roaming Amon Amrûn in the eastern Fields of Fornost. You should defeat shades that patrol the surface of the ruined tombs.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of angry shades at Amon Amrûn.\n",
[10477]="7001758A\n1\tTalk to Dwalin at Thorin's Hall\tDwalin can be found in Thorin's Hall in Ered Luin, far to the west of Moria. Márus has instructed you to go to Thorin's Hall and speak with Dwalin.\n",
[10478]="7000753F\n1\tDefeat brigands (total: 12)\tThe ruffians' camp is west of Bamfurlong. You must ford a stream at the top of a waterfall to enter the camp, which is set on the heights at Narrowcleeve. Farmer Maggot's son Hammy has asked you to drive off the ruffians.\n2\tTalk to Hammy Maggot\tBamfurlong is near the Brandywine River, south of Stock. You have done as Hammy Maggot requested. You should return to him at Bamfurlong to tell him the news.\n",
[10479]="7001E991\n1\tDefeat Nulfríb\030Destroy Nulfríb's standard\tNulfríb is at Gâthlata, south-east of Mithechad, along the central Ashenslades road. Eirien has asked you to defeat Nulfríb and destroy his standard.\n2\tTalk to Eirien at Mithechad\tEirien is at Mithechad, north-west of Gâthlata. You should inform Eirien that Nulfríb has been slain and his standard lies in tatters.\n",
[10480]="7001BC9F\n1\tDefeat Dourhand excavators (total: 6)\030Defeat Dourhand blasters (total: 6)\tDourhands can be found in Sarnúr, south of Thorin's Hall, reached through the ruins of Orodost. Rútur has asked you to seek out the Dourhands of Sarnúr and defeat them.\n2\tTalk to Rútur in Thorin's Hall\tRútur is in Thorin's Hall, north of Sarnúr, just outside the Blue Stone Garrison. You should return to Rútur with news of your victory against the Dourhands of Sarnúr.\n",
[10481]="7006145E\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Mapledore's table\tPostman Mapledore can be found in Gamwich, in Yondershire. Deliver the satchel to Postman Hartclover in Tighfield as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits or those surly Bounders interfere with your duty! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[10482]="7006145C\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman North-took's table\tPostman North-took can be found in Long Cleeve, in Yondershire. Deliver the satchel to Postman Grubb in Nobottle as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits or those surly Bounders interfere with your duty! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[10483]="70061425\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Grubb's table\tPostman Grubb can be found in Nobottle, in Yondershire. Deliver the satchel to Postman North-took in Long Cleeve as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits or those surly Bounders interfere with your duty! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[10484]="7006145B\n1\tCollect the satchel from next to Postman Grubb\tPostman Grubb can be found in Nobottle, in Yondershire. Deliver the satchel to Postman Hartclover in Tighfield as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits or those surly Bounders interfere with your duty! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[10485]="7006145D\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Hartclover's table\tPostman Hartclover can be found in Tighfield, in Yondershire. Deliver the satchel to Postman Mapledore in Gamwich as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits or those surly Bounders interfere with your duty! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[10486]="7006145A\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Hartclover's table\tPostman Hartclover can be found in Tighfield, in Yondershire. Deliver the satchel to Postman Grubb in Nobottle as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits or those surly Bounders interfere with your duty! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[10487]="70071867\n1\tReach rotting area\tThárnar has tasked you with stopping the blight that has crept its way into Sul Madásh before it can spread further. Look for any signs of rot and burn them away.\n2\tBurn rot (total: 2)\tThárnar has tasked you with stopping the blight that has creeped its way into Sul Madásh before it can spread further. Look for any signs of rot and burn them away.\n3\tReach rotting area\tThárnar has tasked you with stopping the blight that has crept its way into Sul Madásh before it can spread further. Look for any signs of rot and burn them away.\n4\tBurn rot (total: 3)\tThárnar has tasked you with stopping the blight that has crept its way into Sul Madásh before it can spread further. Look for any signs of rot and burn them away.\n5\tReach rotting area\tThárnar has tasked you with stopping the blight that has crept its way into Sul Madásh before it can spread further. Look for any signs of rot and burn them away.\n6\tBurn rot (total: 3)\tThárnar has tasked you with stopping the blight that has crept its way into Sul Madásh before it can spread further. Look for any signs of rot and burn them away.\n7\tReturn to Thárnar\tReturn to Thárnar in Sul Madásh to return his torch and let him know that you have burned away the rot found in the settlement.\n",
[10488]="70017581\n1\tCollect Nanulg's horn\tNanulg is at Hurmulkezer, south of Durin's Court along the southern edge of the Flaming Deeps. Garnyd has instructed you to defeat Nanulg and take his horn.\n2\tBring Nanulg's horn to Garnyd at Anazârmekhem\tGarnyd is at Anazârmekhem, in the northern reaches of the Flaming Deeps. You should return to Garnyd with Nanulg's horn.\n",
[10489]="70072EC5\n1\tDestroy barricades (total: 3)\tThe Emax Dûl guard barracks still house many entrenched forces that pose a threat to the ongoing resistance. Enter into the barracks, destroy any fortifications, and rout the forces within.\n2\tDefeat Udupóla Bóro\tSeek out and defeat Udupóla Bóro\n",
[10490]="700281CD\n1\tCollect sigils (total: 5)\tThe hill where Bledhun's party was once encamped lies to the south of Bledhun's current camp. Bledhun asked you to hunt down any Dievlig and recover the sigils stolen from the corpses of his companions.\n2\tTalk to Bledhun at his encampment in the Bonevales\tBledhun is at his camp, north of the hill where his party once encamped. You should bring the sigils that you recovered to Bledhun.\n",
[10491]="70045FE7\n1\tDefeat Morgul Lurkers (total: 8)\tSigns of Morgul Lurkers can be found throughout the First Circle in Minas Tirith. Imrahil has asked you to root out and defeat any enemy forces that may be hiding.\n2\tSpeak with Imrahil\tImrahil can be found outside the front gates of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Imrahil.\n",
[10492]="70071619\n1\tDefeat brigands in Kidu-bâla (total: 12)\030Defeat Nagísu the Keen-eyed\tBrigands make camp in Kidu-bâla, north of Ahâba. You should defeat the brigands and their leader, Nagísu the Keen-eyed, in Kidu-bâla.\n2\tTalk to Kûrmi\tYou have defeated the brigands and their leader in Kidu-bâla. You should return to Kûrmi in Ahâba.\n",
[10493]="7005873E\n1\tRecover notes from goblin spies (total: 8)\tGoblin spies can be found near Zarkul-sulûn. You should recover notes from goblin spies.\n2\tTalk to Langhár\tLanghár can found at Zarkul-sulûn. You should talk to Langhár.\n3\tBurn the goblin notes in the fire pit\tA fire pit is located at Zarkul-sulûn. You should burn the goblin notes in the fire pit.\n",
[10494]="70041AEE\n1\tDefeat Corsairs in southern Ringló (total: 12)\tCorsairs can be found in the southern woods of Ringló Vale. You should defeat Corsairs.\n2\tSpeak with the town guard\tCandúr can be found in the village of Ethring. You should speak with Candúr.\n",
[10495]="7003733D\n1\tExamine the remains of the horse\tThe attackers of the refugees can be summoned by examining the remains of the poor beast that led the cart. You should defeat the attackers of these travelling refugees.\n2\tExamine the remains of the horse\030Defeat the assailant of the slain refugees\tThe attackers of the refugees can be summoned by examining the remains of the poor beast that led the cart. You should defeat the attackers of these travelling refugees.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Orc assailant who massacred the fleeing Rohirrim upon the road as they made their escape from the Stonedeans.\n",
[10496]="70041C81\n1\tFind and defeat Abrakhôr\tAbrakhôr can be found somewhere in Lebennin. Milonnen has asked you to track and defeat the Black Númenórean warrior, Abrakhôr.\n2\tTalk to Milonnen in Ost Anglebed\tMilonnen can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin. You have defeated the Black Númenórean, Abrakhôr, and should now report your success to Milonnen.\n",
})
